{
  "$description": "Design tokens both native platforms read, taken from the web platform's theme (apps/web/platform/app/globals.css): its neutral light palette and its dark palette, its status colours and its radii. The apps use these instead of the Material 3 or iOS system colours, so they look like the platform. `pnpm mobile:generate` writes Swift and Kotlin from this file.",
